@page
@model Group_Project_Offical.Pages.Stock_Manager_DashboardModel
@{
    Layout = "_Layout";
    ViewData["HideNav"] = true;
    ViewData["UserType"] = "stock manager";
}

<body>
    <div class="d-flex" style="min-height:100vh;">

        <div style="background-color:#C2A68C;" class="d-flex flex-column pt-2 fw-bold">
            <a href="Stock_Manager_Dashboard" class="navbar-brand fw-bold text-center px-2 mb-4"
               style="color:#374F40;font-size:1.5rem;line-height:1; align-self:center; margin:0 !important;">
                Sustain <br /> Wear
            </a>
            <a href="Stock_Manager_Handle_Stock"
               class="text-decoration-none text-black mt-4 px-2 d-block fw-bold text-center">
                Handle <br /> Stock
            </a>

            <a href="Doner_Delete_Account"
               class="text-decoration-none text-black d-block mb-4 mt-auto fw-bold text-center">
                Manage <br /> Account
            </a>
        </div>

        <div class="flex-grow-1 m-lg-5 m-sm-3">

            <h1 class="mb-5">Stock Manager Dashboard</h1>
            <h2 class="mt-4 mb-4">Total Sustainability Metrics</h2>

            <div class="metrics-wrapper pt-4 pb-2 mb-4">
                <div class="row row-cols-xl-5 row-cols-lg-4 row-cols-md-3 row-cols-sm-2 g-4 mx-0" style="max-width: 1200px; width: 100%;">
                    <div class="col d-flex">
                        <div class="card card-co2 text-white metric-card w-100 text-center">
                            <div class="card-body py-4">
                                <h4 class="metric-value">@Model.TotalMetrics.TotalCO2Saved.ToString("F1") kg</h4>
                                <p class="metric-label mb-0">CO₂ Saved</p>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="col d-flex">
                        <div class="card card-water text-white metric-card w-100 text-center">
                            <div class="card-body py-4">
                                <h4 class="metric-value">@Model.TotalMetrics.TotalWaterSaved.ToString("F0") L</h4>
                                <p class="metric-label mb-0">Water Saved</p>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="col d-flex">
                        <div class="card card-landfill metric-card w-100 text-center">
                            <div class="card-body py-4">
                                <h4 class="metric-value">@Model.TotalMetrics.TotalLandfillReduction.ToString("F1") kg</h4>
                                <p class="metric-label mb-0">Landfill Reduced</p>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="col d-flex">
                        <div class="card card-items text-white metric-card w-100 text-center">
                            <div class="card-body py-4">
                                <h4 class="metric-value">@Model.TotalMetrics.TotalItemsSaved</h4>
                                <p class="metric-label mb-0">Items Saved</p>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="col d-flex">
                        <div class="card card-people text-white metric-card w-100 text-center">
                            <div class="card-body py-4">
                                <h4 class="metric-value">@Model.TotalMetrics.TotalBeneficiariesSupported</h4>
                                <p class="metric-label mb-0">People Helped</p>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <p class="mb-3">
                We are incredibly proud to celebrate the significant milestones SustainWear
                has reached in our commitment to environmental stewardship. Your collective
                across all teams have translated into tangible, measurable positive impacts
                that reinforce our mission as a responsible charitable distribution organization.
                Thanks to your dedication to optimized logistics and sustainable sourcing,
                we are delighted to announce that in the last period, we successfully saved
                over 200 metric tons of material from landfill, ensuring that valuable resources
                were channeled back into communities instead of contributing to waste burdens.
                Furthermore, your efforts in route optimization, consolidating shipments, and
                increasing the use of lower-emission transportation partners have helped us
                prevent the emission of 300 metric tons of C02 equivalent. This reduction is
                vital in combating climate change and reducing our operational footprint,
                and we have also enhanced the lifespan of 1000 units of clothing
                and goods, extending their utility and delaying the need for new production,
                which inherently conserves water, energy, and raw materials. These achievements
                are not merely numbers; they represent thousands of deliberate, sustainable choices
                made by each of you, and this success belongs to everyone at SustainWear!
            </p>

            <p class="mb-5">
                While we pause
                to recognize these accomplishments, the pursuit of a fully circular and sustainable future
                demands continuous improvement. For the upcoming cycle, we are setting even more ambitious
                targets to cement SustainWear's leadership in ethical operations, focusing on three key areas:
                First, our major objective is to reduce our non-recyclable packaging waste by an additional 15%,
                which will involve implementing new, standardized reusable tote systems and transitioning entirely
                to compostable mailing materials. Second, we will be deepening our efforts in supply chain
                transparency, investing in new tracking technology to achieve 100% visibility on the origin and
                environmental cost of our sourced materials by the end of the second quarter, ensuring our ethical
                standards extend to every component we distribute. Finally, a crucial focus will be on the
                reduction of our facility-level energy consumption by 10%, and we urge all staff to actively
                participate by being mindful of lighting, HVAC usage, and optimizing machinery run times.
                I urge every employee to embrace this renewed challenge; your ingenuity, operational
                efficiency, and commitment are the driving forces behind our ability to meet these next-generation metrics.
                Let us maintain this momentum, continue to innovate, and proudly lead the way in responsible
                distribution. By working together, we will ensure SustainWear remains synonymous with positive impact.
            </p>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
